# CubalC self-evolve gen=1671 — braincube solves · algocube optimizes (pure C emitter)
HOLD_FLASH 1
SHARE state_matrix_only
BUDGET 40
GENESIS "NEXUS_COORD v1 | from=cubalc_evolve | type=self_evolve | gen=1671 | E=277972 | face=3 | diff=4.00 | fit=0.938 | hold_flash=1 | algocube=1 |"

CUBE brain ROLE braincube PROTON 1
CUBE algo  ROLE algocube  PROTON 1
CUBE meta  ROLE meta      PROTON 1
CUBE hive  ROLE nanobot_hive PROTON 1
CUBE create ROLE construct PROTON 1
CUBE destroy ROLE deconstruct PROTON 0
CUBE a ROLE peer PROTON 1
CUBE b ROLE peer PROTON 1

PLUG brain algo
PLUG algo meta
PLUG meta hive
PLUG create destroy
PLUG brain hive
PLUG a b

FOLDBITS algo "1111101111111010110011011111011100111101111011000110011001011111"
FOLDBITS brain "1110000111000100110001110101000011011111001110101101000000011001"
FOLDBITS a "1111101111111010110011011111011100111101111011000110011001011111"
FOLDBITS b "1111101111111010110011011111011100111101111011000110011001011111"

SETDIGIT algo 3
SETDIGIT brain 5

IMPULSE create 1
IMPULSE hive 1
IMPULSE brain 1
FLOW 4

COMPARE a b
DECIDE algo
DECIDE brain
HARMONY hive

ASSERT CUBES >= 6
ASSERT DECIDE >= 0
ASSERT DECIDE <= 9
ASSERT HARMONY >= 0
